      "example": "[{\"Source\":\"client-model-a\",\"Target\":\"upstream-model-a\"},{\"Source\":\"client-model-b\",\"Target\":\"upstream-model-b\"}]",
      "help_en": "The model name mappings, specified as a JSON array string. Each element is in the format of {\"Source\":\"client model name\",\"Target\":\"upstream model name\"}. The Source parameter is matched in a case-insensitive manner and must be unique. The Target parameter retains its original case when forwarded. Both parameters cannot be empty and cannot contain leading or trailing spaces",
