      "location": "query",
      "name": "model_mappings",
      "options": [
        "--model-mappings"
      ],
      "raw_name": "ModelMappings",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "{\"AllowedModels\":[\"deepseek-v4-pro\",\"glm-5.3\",\"glm-5.3-flash\"]}",
      "help_en": "The intelligent routing candidate list, specified as a JSON object string. Currently, it only contains AllowedModels, which is a non-empty array of unique model names. The order of the array determines the candidate order. Do not pass the Enabled, cost, or quality tier parameters. Saving candidates does not enable the feature. You must first call the EnableModelRouting operation to obtain the gateway entitlements",
      "help_zh": "智能路由候选列表，JSON 对象字符串，当前仅含 AllowedModels：非空、不重复的模型名数组，顺序即候选顺序；不传 Enabled、成本或质量档位。保存候选不等于开通，需先调用 EnableModelRouting 获得网关权益",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "model_routing",
      "options": [
        "--model-routing"
      ],
      "raw_name": "ModelRouting",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "example": "{\n\t\"failover\": {\n\t\t\"enabled\": true,\n\t\t\"max_provider_retries\": 2,\n\t\t\"max_failover_providers\": 1,\n\t\t\"retryable_status_codes\": [429, 500, 502, 503, 504],\n\t\t\"retry_delay\": 0.5\n\t}\n}",
      "help_en": "The gateway retry configuration",
      "help_zh": "网关重试配置",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "config",
      "options": [
        "--config"
      ],
      "raw_name": "Config",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    },
